<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 8.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 8.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali speaks on ninth anniversary his succession to Habib Bourguiba; announces measures to enhance economic activity and political pluralism.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President says he is determined to consolidate democratic process.</p>
</text>
